message: "If you use this research package, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Cloitre recurrence research package"
abstract: >-
  An AI-assisted research package curated by the repository maintainer,
  containing proofs, computational certificates, and verification software
  concerning stabilization and attainable eventual increments in the
  recurrence b(n+1) = b(n) + (b(n) mod n). The universal stabilization
  conjecture remains open, and the principal new proofs await external
  mathematical review.
